{"version":1,"content":"<p>中朝關係升溫。</p><p>中共中央黨校常務副校長謝春濤周一率團抵達平壤，應中國共產黨中央委員會邀請，由朝鮮勞動黨中央政治局委員、黨中央書記金成男率領的朝鮮勞動黨代表團3日乘機離開平壤，赴中國進行正式訪問。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:05:37.803860+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:03:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:58:23.674928+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T07:58:27.180427+00:00","content_hash":"599a71f5c9f5847d51ade4fcd46c6f449e38b93216fb1a153c692e4ebbfa6b7d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}